><br><br><strong>EXTRA FORCE</strong><br>You have 4 arms, why not to use them? Break ur enemies neck\u2019s, rip them apart or hit them as hard as they fly through the air. Won`t this satisfy you enough? Then you can rip apart some of Nazis` vehicles - their trucks or even their tanks!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725370/extras/baed84a1ca18387c39e356428e237eba.poster.avif?t=1701254219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725370/extras/baed84a1ca18387c39e356428e237eba.webm?t=1701254219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1725370/extras/baed84a1ca18387c39e356428e237eba.mp4?t=1701254219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
